      },
      "text": ": “Que",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12859803010781898,
        "y0": 0.5300893879884034,
        "x1": 0.2476151729213877,
        "y1": 0.5470227312935945
      },
      "text": "bom, então!”",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2476151729213877,
        "y0": 0.5300893879884034,
        "x1": 0.8823829264982078,
        "y1": 0.5470227312935945
      },
      "text": ". Nessa etapa de sua análise, embora com a predominância de",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12862223805518086,
        "y0": 0.5498505965249736,
        "x1": 0.8778544562128292,
        "y1": 0.5667839398301647
      },
      "text": "características da posição esquizoparanoide, Karlo não perde sua capacidade de",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12862223805518086,
        "y0": 0.5696118050615439,
        "x1": 0.41713723020099325,
        "y1": 0.5865451483667349
      },
      "text": "brincar, vivendo suas fantasias.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15719118407677996,
        "y0": 0.5893730135981141,
        "x1": 0.8804307723999238,
        "y1": 0.6063063569033051
      },
      "text": "Karlo encena em diversas sessões, com pequenas variações, lutas entre os",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1286222303652357,
        "y0": 0.6091342221346843,
        "x1": 0.8750411589857562,
        "y1": 0.6260675654398753
      },
      "text": "bichos ferozes, incluindo outros objetos, mas a bacia com água continua presente",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1286222303652357,
        "y0": 0.6288954306712544,
        "x1": 0.8783600777970072,
        "y1": 0.6458287739764454
      },
      "text": "no cenário lúdico. Pega o leão e coloca na água, depois o jacaré, comenta que",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1286222303652357,
        "y0": 0.6486566392078247,
        "x1": 0.13839518941973317,
        "y1": 0.6655899825130157
      },
      "text": "“",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.13863708433466837,
        "y0": 0.6486566392078247,
        "x1": 0.2726523270698322,
        "y1": 0.6655899825130157
      },
      "text": "está sem olho”.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2726522963100516,
        "y0": 0.6486566392078247,
        "x1": 0.8790373850968148,
        "y1": 0.6655899825130157
      },
      "text": "Eu vejo e realmente tem só um olho. Pede que retire o durex",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12862220729540025,
        "y0": 0.6684178477443949,
        "x1": 0.87896239275162,
        "y1": 0.685351191049586
      },
      "text": "que eu havia colocado para segurar a mandíbula do jacaré. Ele pergunta se já",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12862220729540025,
        "y0": 0.6881790562809651,
        "x1": 0.8778496269272691,
        "y1": 0.7051123995861561
      },
      "text": "está colado. Pega o cavalinho e o tigre, põe na água. Procura o filhote que está",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12862220729540025,
        "y0": 0.7079402648175352,
        "x1": 0.8786455670110513,
        "y1": 0.7248736081227263
      },
      "text": "no chão. Bate com força a cabeça do boneco na mesa, respingando água para",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12862220729540025,
        "y0": 0.7277014733541054,
        "x1": 0.5058968842147444,
        "y1": 0.7446348166592965
      },
      "text": "todos os lados. Com muita raiva fala: “",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5058968534549638,
        "y0": 0.7277014733541054,
        "x1": 0.8787228970995745,
        "y1": 0.7446348166592965
      },
      "text": "tinha medo de trovão e agora não tenho",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12862220729540025,
        "y0": 0.7474626818906757,
        "x1": 0.17102810227930035,
        "y1": 0.7643960251958667
      },
      "text": "mais",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17102810227930035,
        "y0": 0.7474626818906757,
        "x1": 0.19618618850532216,
        "y1": 0.7643960251958667
      },
      "text": "...",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.19517019295085755,
        "y0": 0.7474626818906757,
        "x1": 0.8766884452081943,
        "y1": 0.7643960251958667
      },
      "text": "Sei me cuidar, não me machuco mais, não tem mais pesadelo. Já sei matar...",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12862219191550991,
        "y0": 0.7672238904272459,
        "x1": 0.877777079984635,
        "y1": 0.784157233732437
      },
      "text": "Sonhei com monstros, monstros diferentes... Era um lobo que queria me comer, já",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1286222688149615,
        "y0": 0.7869850989638161,
        "x1": 0.3041725817642807,
        "y1": 0.8039184422690071
      },
      "text": "sei matar os maus”.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1571912148365606,
        "y0": 0.8067463075003862,
        "x1": 0.8819257900182601,
        "y1": 0.8236796508055774
      },
      "text": "O menino continua a encenação que mais parece estar sonhando ali na",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12862226112501635,
        "y0": 0.8265075160369565,
        "x1": 0.3585406709102276,
        "y1": 0.8434408593421475
      },
      "text": "sessão.  Pega o pincel, “",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.35860112156912594,
        "y0": 0.8265075160369565,
        "x1": 0.879678449685086,
        "y1": 0.8434408593421475
      },
      "text": "é um tubarão que está se aproximando, para espantar o",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1286222688149615,
        "y0": 0.8462687245735266,
        "x1": 0.26601209018444044,
        "y1": 0.8632020678787178
      },
      "text": "jacaré da água”",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.26604835596581233,
        "y0": 0.8462687245735266,
        "x1": 0.8770103155527876,
        "y1": 0.8632020678787178
      },
      "text": ". O jacaré sai. Vimos que o tubarão é brabo e perigoso e que veio",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.124285624211585,
        "y0": 0.92472409176908,
        "x1": 0.15253607577451572,
        "y1": 0.9402463231321717
      },
      "text": "40",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15252357192368649,
        "y0": 0.9289574275953777,
        "x1": 0.5413451936564131,
        "y1": 0.9402463231321717
      },
      "text": "| Psicanálise, Porto Alegre, 23 (2), 35-45, 2021",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
